    "sentence_translations": [
      "(13) Adventure",
      "",
      "Old Guan answered the phone. Little Dong was really happy. He asked Old Guan, “Where have you been these five days?”",
      "",
      "“Little Dong, I went on an adventure,” Old Guan was smiling. She was very happy.",
      "",
      "“Adventure? Where did you go for your adventure? It’s been five days! I called, and you weren’t there!” Little Dong said.",
      "",
      "“Sorry, Little Dong. I went to see the sea,” Old Guan said.",
      "",
      "“The sea? The sea is in Beijing?” Little Dong asked.",
      "",
      "“There is no sea in Beijing. I took a plane. I took a plane to Hainan,” Old Guan said.",
      "",
      "“You took a plane? You went to Hainan? Did you see the sea?” Little Dong asked.",
      "",
      "Old Guan said: “Yes, I saw the sea. It was so beautiful! It was really so beautiful!",
      "I have done a lot of thinking these five days. Now I think that having friends is great.",
      "I think that life can be very interesting!”"
    ]
